u='s3-u09'
write(u,'名额不多，材料有的是',['Distinguish minimum amounts from exact limits','Use only and plentiful expressions without conflating supplies and places','Check an event notice before signing up'],[
('光','only; solely','chỉ','adverb','光有材料，不等于还有名额。','Having materials alone does not mean places remain.'),('仅','only; merely','chỉ','adverb','现在仅剩两个名额。','Only two places remain now.'),('仅仅','only; merely','chỉ vỏn vẹn','adverb','仅仅看标题，还不知道规则。','Reading only the title does not reveal the rules.'),('至少','at least','ít nhất','adverb','至少提前一天报名。','Sign up at least one day in advance.'),('有的是','there is plenty of','có rất nhiều','expression','材料有的是，名额却不多。','There are plenty of materials, but few places.'),('目前','at present','hiện tại','noun','目前还有两个名额。','At present two places remain.'),('近期','in the near future; recently','gần đây; sắp tới','noun','近期的活动先看日期。','For upcoming events, check the date first.'),('空','empty; vacant','trống','adjective','空座位不一定是可报名的名额。','An empty seat is not necessarily an available place.'),('公布','to announce publicly','công bố','verb','名单明天公布。','The list will be announced tomorrow.'),('规定','rule; to stipulate','quy định','noun','规定写着至少提前一天报名。','The rule says to sign up at least one day ahead.'),('保证','to guarantee','bảo đảm','verb','我不能保证一定有名额。','I cannot guarantee a place will be available.'),('确定','to confirm; definite','xác nhận','verb','先确定日期，再报名。','Confirm the date before signing up.'),('票价','ticket price','giá vé','noun','票价不是所有费用。','The ticket price is not every expense.'),('费用','expense; cost','chi phí','noun','费用总共二十块。','The total expense is twenty yuan.'),('价格','price','giá','noun','价格写在通知上。','The price is on the notice.'),('价钱','price','giá tiền','noun','价钱一样，规则也要看。','Even with the same price, check the rules.'),('必要','necessary','cần thiết','adjective','看完整通知很有必要。','Reading the whole notice is necessary.'),('场所','place; venue','địa điểm','noun','这个场所能坐十个人。','This venue seats ten people.'),('场合','occasion; situation','hoàn cảnh; dịp','noun','不同场合有不同规定。','Different occasions have different rules.'),('公共','public; communal','công cộng','adjective','公共空间不能随便占座。','Do not casually reserve seats in a public space.'),('有效','effective; valid','có hiệu lực','adjective','报名确认今天仍然有效。','The registration confirmation remains valid today.'),('取消','to cancel','hủy','verb','要取消，请先联系负责人。','To cancel, contact the organizer first.')],
[grammar(u,'三13','光 / 仅 / 仅仅 / 就 / 至少','Read scope and minimum quantities accurately',
'光带笔就行 means a pen alone suffices in this context; it does not claim pens are the only permitted object. 仅/仅仅 restrict scope. 就两个人 emphasizes a small exact count. 至少两个人 sets a minimum of two, allowing more. 至少提前一天 sets a minimum lead time, not exactly one day. Keep only, sufficiency and minimum distinct.',[('仅剩两个名额。','Only two places remain.'),('就两个人，不是至少两个人。','Exactly two people, not at least two.'),('至少提前一天报名。','Sign up at least one day ahead.')],('至少两个就是只能两个。','至少两个，可以更多。','A minimum does not impose a maximum.')),
grammar(u,'三37','有的是：充足的数量','Describe plentiful supplies without claiming unlimited capacity',
'材料有的是 / 有的是材料 says materials are plentiful. It does not give an exact number and does not transfer that abundance to seats, time or places. Distinguish the idiomatic plentiful construction from 有的材料…: some of the materials. In a practical notice, verify each resource separately.',[('材料有的是，名额只有两个。','There are plenty of materials but only two places.'),('有的是纸，不是有的是时间。','There is plenty of paper, not plenty of time.'),('有的材料要带回家。','Some of the materials need taking home.')],('材料有的是，所以名额一定够。','材料有的是，名额还要确认。','Abundance in one resource does not prove another is available.'))],
text(u,'d','Plenty of paper, two places','Find the exact limit and the minimum lead time.',[
('这个活动还有名额吗？','Does this event still have places?'),('目前仅剩两个，材料有的是。','At present only two remain; there are plenty of materials.'),('至少提前一天报名，是只能提前一天吗？','At least one day ahead: does that mean only one day ahead?'),('不是，提前两天也可以。','No, two days ahead is also fine.'),('费用呢？','And the expense?'),('总共二十块，价格写在通知上。','Twenty yuan total; the price is on the notice.'),('那我和朋友先确定日期，不保证一定有名额。','Then my friend and I will confirm the date first; there is no guaranteed place.'),('对，名单明天公布。','Correct; the list will be announced tomorrow.')],
[('mainidea','What needs separate checking?',['Places, date and cost','Only the paper colour','A guaranteed seat for everyone'],0),('detail','How many places currently remain?',['Two','At least twenty','None'],0),('inference','May someone sign up two days ahead?',['Yes','No, exactly one day only','Only after the list appears'],0)],drama=True),
text(u,'r','Read the whole notice','Find which amounts are exact and which are minimums.',[
('目前仅剩两个名额，场所还有空座位，也不能直接占座。','Only two places remain; even empty seats at the venue cannot simply be reserved.'),('材料有的是，光有材料不等于名额够。','Materials are plentiful; materials alone do not establish sufficient places.'),('规定是至少提前一天报名，提前两天也可以。','The rule is at least one day ahead; two days ahead is acceptable.'),('费用总共二十块人民币，不是另加票价。','The total expense is twenty yuan, not an additional ticket price.'),('名单明天公布，报名确认的有效期要看清楚。','The list appears tomorrow; read the confirmation’s validity period carefully.'),('不同场合有不同规定；要取消，先联系负责人。','Different occasions have different rules; contact the organizer before cancelling.')],
[('mainidea','What is the notice’s advice?',['Check limits and conditions separately','Assume empty seats are available places','Count paper as money'],0),('detail','Is the ticket price added to the twenty yuan?',['No','Yes','The notice says fifty'],0),('inference','Do plentiful materials guarantee a place?',['No','Yes','Only if paper is white'],0)],[(0,'名额'),(2,'至少')]),
text(u,'media','Paper is not a chair','Read an original scene about a mistaken inference.',[
('材料有的是，那我一定能来吧？','Materials are plentiful, so I can definitely come, right?'),('纸能装进包，你不能坐进纸里。','Paper fits in a bag; you cannot sit inside the paper.'),('好，我查名额，不跟纸抢座位。','Fine; I will check places and not compete with paper for a seat.'),('这次看完整通知。','Read the whole notice this time.')],
[('inference','What is the joke correcting?',['Confusing supplies with places','A ban on bags','A missing paper price'],0)],drama=True),
dict(tf=[('仅','目前仅剩两个名额。','Only two places currently remain.','Exactly two places remain.',True,'仅 restricts the remaining number.'),('至少','至少提前一天报名。','Sign up at least one day ahead.','Two days ahead is too early.',False,'At least permits a longer lead time.')],reply=[('保证','材料多，就保证有名额吗？','Do plentiful materials guarantee a place?',['不能保证，还要确认名额。','保证，纸就是座位。','至少就是零个。'],0,'Check the resource that actually limits entry.'),('费用','二十块还要另加票价吗？','Is a ticket price added to the twenty yuan?',['不用，总共二十块。','要加二十个人。','明天是一个名额。'],0,'总共 states the total.')],fill=[('目前','目前仅剩两个名额。','At present only two places remain.'),('规定','先看规定，再报名。','Check the rules before registering.')],match=[('取消',[('名单明天公布。','The list appears tomorrow.'),('先确定日期。','Confirm the date first.'),('取消前先联系。','Contact before cancelling.')]),('有的是',[('材料有的是。','Materials are plentiful.'),('仅剩两个名额。','Only two places remain.'),('至少提前一天。','At least one day ahead.')])]),
[('Check availability','材料够，名额还要确认。','Materials suffice; places still need confirmation.','Do not transfer one resource’s abundance to another.'),('Ask about cancellation','要取消的话，先联系谁？','Whom should I contact to cancel?','Read the actual cancellation rule.')],
[('现在剩几个名额？','How many places remain now?','State the exact number',['仅剩两个。']),('什么时候报名？','When should one sign up?','Give the minimum lead time',['至少提前一天。'])],
'Native check: 光 sufficiency scope versus 仅 restriction, 就 quantity emphasis, minimum lead time, idiomatic 有的是 versus 有的; price includes total expenses. Paper/chair joke and confirmation validity phrasing need native style review. Native review pending.')

u='s3-u10'
write(u,'老朋友突然回来',['Describe earlier experiences without inventing current habits','Anchor changes with 自从','Distinguish quick action from a newly realized fact'],[
('本来','originally; originally intended','ban đầu','adverb','本来想明天联系，今天就收到消息了。','Originally intended to contact tomorrow, but received a message today.'),('曾经','once; formerly','đã từng','adverb','她曾经住在这个小区。','She once lived in this community.'),('从来','ever; always, often with negation','từ trước tới nay','adverb','她从来没来过这个新地方。','She has never been to this new place.'),('赶紧','quickly; hurry to','mau chóng','adverb','地址写错了，赶紧改。','The address is wrong; correct it quickly.'),('赶快','quickly; promptly','nhanh chóng','adverb','赶快联系她，别让她走错。','Contact her quickly so she does not go the wrong way.'),('立刻','immediately','ngay lập tức','adverb','看到消息，我立刻回复。','On seeing the message, I replied immediately.'),('连忙','hurriedly; promptly in response','vội vàng','adverb','发现地址错了，我连忙发新地址。','On discovering the wrong address, I hurriedly sent the new one.'),('始终','throughout; all along','suốt; luôn','adverb','她始终没答应参加聚会。','Throughout, she has not agreed to attend the gathering.'),('已','already, written form','đã','adverb','通知写着地点已改变。','The notice says the venue has changed.'),('早已','long since; already long ago','đã từ lâu','adverb','旧店早已搬走。','The old shop moved away long ago.'),('自从','since','từ khi','preposition','自从毕业，我们很少见面。','Since graduation we have rarely met.'),('从前','formerly; in the past','trước đây','noun','从前我们常在旧店见面。','We formerly often met at the old shop.'),('过去','the past; formerly','trước kia','noun','过去的地址不能直接当现在的地址。','The former address cannot simply be used as the current address.'),('当初','at that time; originally','lúc đó','noun','当初没想到店会搬走。','At the time we did not expect the shop to move.'),('至今','up to now','cho tới nay','adverb','至今还没定聚会时间。','The gathering time is still unsettled up to now.'),('年代','era; decade','thời đại; thập niên','noun','不同年代的照片放在不同页。','Photos from different eras are on different pages.'),('年初','beginning of the year','đầu năm','noun','年初我们通过一次电话。','We had one phone call at the beginning of the year.'),('年底','end of the year','cuối năm','noun','年底再见的计划还没定。','The plan to meet at year-end is not settled.'),('变化','change','thay đổi','noun','店的位置有变化。','The shop’s location has changed.'),('变为','to become; change into','trở thành','verb','旧店变为新的书店。','The old shop became a new bookshop.'),('成长','to grow; mature','trưởng thành','verb','我们在不同地方成长。','We grew up in different places.'),('印象','impression','ấn tượng','noun','旧地址的印象很深，仍然要查新通知。','The old address left a strong impression; still check the new notice.')],
[grammar(u,'三14','本来 / 才 / 曾经 / 从来 / 赶紧 / 赶快 / 立刻 / 连忙 / 始终 / 已 / 早已','Distinguish event time, quick response and prior expectations',
'本来 presents an original situation or intention that may contrast with now. 曾经 marks a past experience, not a current habit. 从来没… means never up to the reference time; 从来都… can describe a consistent habit. 才知道 here is only then realizing, unlike 才两个 quantity limitation. 赶紧/赶快 urge prompt action, 立刻 means immediately, 连忙 a prompt response to circumstances. 始终 throughout covers a period. 已 is concise written 已经; 早已 emphasizes completion long before now.',[('本来想明天问，今天才知道她已经到了。','Originally meant to ask tomorrow; only today learned she had arrived.'),('发现地址错了，我连忙联系她。','On finding the wrong address, I hurriedly contacted her.'),('她曾经住这里，旧店早已搬走。','She once lived here; the old shop moved long ago.')],('她曾经住这里，所以现在一定住这里。','她曾经住这里，现在要再确认。','Past experience does not prove the present situation.')),
grammar(u,'三21','自从 + 时间或事件','Anchor a continuing situation after a past starting point',
'自从毕业，我们很少见面 establishes graduation as the starting point for infrequent meetings. The following clause supplies the subsequent situation; 自从 alone does not explain why it occurred. 自从她搬走以后 can include 以后. Do not use future 明天 as an already established past starting point.',[('自从毕业，我们很少见面。','Since graduation we have rarely met.'),('自从她搬走以后，我们通过几次电话。','Since she moved away, we have had several phone calls.'),('自从年初见过一次，至今还没再见。','Since meeting once at year-start, we have not met again yet.')],('自从明天毕业，我们过去没见面。','自从去年毕业，我们很少见面。','Align the established starting event and later situation.'))],
text(u,'d','A message before the planned call','Find which address is current and what remains undecided.',[
('本来想明天联系你，没想到你今天回来了。','I meant to contact you tomorrow; I did not expect you back today.'),('我曾经住这里，可从来没去过新店。','I once lived here, but have never visited the new shop.'),('旧店早已搬走，我今天才发现通知上的地址也错了。','The old shop moved long ago; only today I discovered the notice’s address was wrong too.'),('那赶紧发新地址，我还没出发。','Then send the new address quickly; I have not set off.'),('好，我立刻发。聚会时间至今还没定。','Okay, I will send it immediately. The gathering time is still unsettled.'),('自从毕业，我们很少见面。先定时间吧。','Since graduation we have rarely met. Let us settle the time first.')],
[('mainidea','What do the friends need to update?',['Address and meeting time','A promise to attend every day','A graduation date tomorrow'],0),('detail','Has the returning friend set off?',['No','Yes','She has reached the old shop'],0),('inference','Does a past residence prove familiarity with the new shop?',['No','Yes','Only at year-end'],0)],drama=True),
text(u,'r','An old address in a new message','Read the difference between memory and the current notice.',[
('从前我们常在旧店见面，自从毕业以后，见面的机会少了。','We formerly met often at the old shop; since graduation, chances to meet have decreased.'),('年初通过一次电话，至今还没再见。','We had one call at year-start and have not met again yet.'),('朋友曾经住这里，但从来没去过新店。','The friend once lived here but has never visited the new shop.'),('旧店早已搬走，原来的地方变为新的书店。','The old shop moved long ago; its former site became a new bookshop.'),('我今天才发现通知地址错了，连忙发送新地址。','Only today I discovered the wrong notice address and hurriedly sent the new one.'),('地点已改变，时间还没定；年底再见只是计划。','The venue has changed; the time is unsettled, and meeting at year-end is only a plan.')],
[('mainidea','What should the record separate?',['Past facts, changed venue and unsettled plans','Every memory as current proof','Year-start as the confirmed next meeting'],0),('detail','What occupies the former shop’s site?',['A new bookshop','The unchanged old shop','A railway'],0),('inference','Is the year-end meeting confirmed?',['No','Yes','Only because one call occurred'],0)],[(2,'曾经'),(4,'连忙')]),
text(u,'media','The address did not wait','Read an original verse about memory and change.',[
('从前的店，记得很深。','The former shop is strongly remembered.'),('今天的路，还要再问。','Today’s route still needs asking.'),('自从毕业，见得不多。','Since graduation, we have rarely met.'),('时间没定，先别说准。','The time is unsettled; do not call it certain yet.')],
[('inference','Why ask again despite remembering the shop?',['The current situation may have changed','Graduation erases all memory','The meeting is already confirmed'],0)]),
dict(tf=[('曾经','她曾经住这里。','She once lived here.','She necessarily lives here now.',False,'曾经 marks past experience.'),('至今','时间至今还没定。','The time remains unsettled.','The time is not confirmed yet.',True,'还没定 states the current status.')],reply=[('连忙','发现地址错了，怎么办？','What should one do on finding the wrong address?',['赶紧发新地址。','把旧地址当现在的。','说她肯定已经到了。'],0,'Respond to the changed information.'),('自从','自从毕业，你们常见面吗？','Have you met often since graduation?',['很少见面，还没定下次时间。','明天曾经毕业。','旧店就是所有年代。'],0,'Answer the stated pattern and pending plan.')],fill=[('早已','旧店早已搬走。','The old shop moved away long ago.'),('本来','本来想明天联系。','Originally intended to contact tomorrow.')],match=[('过去',[('她还没出发。','She has not set off.'),('地点已改变。','The venue has changed.'),('时间还没定。','The time is unsettled.')]),('年初',[('年初通过一次电话。','Had one call at year-start.'),('年底再见只是计划。','Meeting at year-end is only a plan.'),('今天才发现地址错了。','Only today noticed the wrong address.')])]),
[('Correct an outdated message','旧地址错了，我现在发新地址。','The old address is wrong; I will send the new one now.','Do not blame a friend for following outdated information.'),('State the unsettled part','地点变了，时间还没定。','The venue changed; the time is not settled.','Separate known change from future intention.')],
[('你去过新店吗？','Have you visited the new shop?','State the lack of experience',['从来没去过。']),('聚会时间定了吗？','Is the gathering time settled?','Do not overpromise',['还没定。'])],
'Native check: adverb family 本来/才/曾经/从来/赶紧/赶快/立刻/连忙/始终/已/早已, written 已 register, 自从 time anchoring, and economical verse phrasing. No inferred current residence or confirmed future meeting. Native review pending.')

u='s3-u11'
write(u,'平时怎么过',['Describe habits without turning usually into always','State how long an action lasts','Separate completed duration from an ongoing interval'],[
('通常','usual; normally','thông thường','adverb','我们通常周末散步。','We usually walk at weekends.'),('往往','often; tends to','thường','adverb','周末她往往先看天气。','At weekends she tends to check the weather first.'),('总','always; invariably','luôn','adverb','他总忘记带水，今天先提醒他。','He always forgets water; remind him today.'),('总是','always','luôn luôn','adverb','她总是先问朋友有没有空。','She always asks whether her friend is free first.'),('日常','everyday; daily','hằng ngày','adjective','这是日常活动，不是比赛。','This is an everyday activity, not a competition.'),('长期','long-term','dài hạn','noun','长期计划可以慢慢调整。','A long-term plan can be adjusted gradually.'),('短期','short-term','ngắn hạn','noun','短期目标是先养成习惯。','The short-term goal is to establish the habit first.'),('定期','regularly; at set intervals','định kỳ','adverb','我们定期整理记录。','We organize our records regularly.'),('持续','to last; continue','kéo dài','verb','今天的散步持续了二十分钟。','Today’s walk lasted twenty minutes.'),('连续','consecutive; continuous','liên tục','adjective','连续两天都去了，不等于每天都去。','Going on two consecutive days does not mean going every day.'),('坚持','to persist; keep at','kiên trì','verb','坚持练习，也要休息。','Keep practising, and also rest.'),('保持','to maintain','duy trì','verb','保持合适的速度，不跟别人比赛。','Maintain a suitable speed, without racing others.'),('经历','experience; to experience','trải nghiệm','noun','每个人的经历不同。','Everyone’s experience is different.'),('经验','experience; practical knowledge','kinh nghiệm','noun','有经验，也要看今天的天气。','Even with experience, check today’s weather.'),('整天','all day','cả ngày','noun','不是整天跑步，只练二十分钟。','Not running all day: practising for just twenty minutes.'),('整整','a full; exactly all of','trọn; đúng','adverb','我们走了整整二十分钟。','We walked for a full twenty minutes.'),('久','long in time','lâu','adjective','很久没见，先慢慢聊。','We have not met in a long time; chat at an easy pace first.'),('散步','to take a walk','đi dạo','verb','晚饭后散步，不是赶路。','Take a walk after dinner, rather than hurry somewhere.'),('跑步','to run; jog','chạy bộ','verb','她今天没跑步，只散步。','She did not jog today; she only walked.'),('营养','nutrition; nourishment','dinh dưỡng','noun','日常饮食也要注意营养。','Everyday meals also need attention to nutrition.'),('暖和','warm','ấm áp','adjective','今天暖和，但出门前仍要看天气。','Today is warm, but still check the weather before going out.'),('困','sleepy; trapped','buồn ngủ','adjective','我有点困，今天先休息。','I am a little sleepy; I will rest first today.')],
[grammar(u,'三15','通常 / 往往 / 总 / 总是','Describe usual patterns and repeated behaviour',
'通常 presents the usual situation with possible exceptions. 往往 emphasizes a tendency, often linked to circumstances. 总/总是 describes recurring behaviour and may be emphatic rather than a mathematically proved every-time claim. 他总忘记带水 is a conversational complaint, not a measured score. Distinguish habitual 总是 from 已经 for completion and 一直 for continuation.',[('我们通常周末散步，但这周休息。','We usually walk at weekends, but rest this week.'),('天气暖和时，她往往出去走走。','When it is warm, she tends to go for a walk.'),('她总是先问朋友有没有空。','She always asks whether her friend is free first.')],('通常去，所以这周一定去了。','通常去，但这周要再问。','A usual pattern allows an exception.')),
grammar(u,'三51','动词 + 时量补语：持续多久','Place duration correctly with actions and objects',
'走了二十分钟 describes a completed interval. 看书看了二十分钟 / 看了二十分钟书 both place duration with the action. 我学汉语学了两年了 normally presents an interval continuing to now; 我学了两年汉语 does not alone establish that it continues. Wait-duration 等了二十分钟 also does not prove the other person arrived. Do not treat a duration as a clock time.',[('我们走了二十分钟。','We walked for twenty minutes.'),('她看书看了半个小时。','She read for half an hour.'),('我等了二十分钟，她还没到。','I waited twenty minutes; she has not arrived yet.')],('我二十分钟看书了。','我看书看了二十分钟。','Use the verb-duration construction, not an unanchored time fragment.'))],
text(u,'d','A usual walk, an unusual week','Find today’s action and completed duration.',[
('你通常周末跑步吗？','Do you usually jog at weekends?'),('通常先散步，今天不跑。','Usually I walk first; I am not jogging today.'),('这周我们连续两天都出去走了。','This week we went out walking on two consecutive days.'),('每次多久？今天走了整整二十分钟。','How long each time? Today we walked a full twenty minutes.'),('我有点困，明天想休息，不是整天都练。','I am a little sleepy; I want to rest tomorrow, rather than practise all day.'),('好，坚持不是不休息；下次再问你有没有空。','Fine; persistence does not mean never resting. I will ask whether you are free next time.')],
[('mainidea','What do the friends distinguish?',['Habit, today’s walk and rest','Every day as a confirmed run','Twenty minutes as a clock time'],0),('detail','How long was today’s walk?',['Twenty minutes','Two days','All day'],0),('inference','Do two consecutive days prove a daily habit forever?',['No','Yes','Only in warm weather'],0)],drama=True),
text(u,'r','A small activity record','Read what was actually done rather than assume an unbroken streak.',[
('我们通常周末散步，这周连续两天去了。','We usually walk at weekends; this week we went on two consecutive days.'),('今天没跑步，散步持续了整整二十分钟。','There was no jogging today; the walk lasted a full twenty minutes.'),('朋友往往先看天气，我总是先问她有没有空。','My friend tends to check the weather; I always ask whether she is free first.'),('看书看了半个小时，也不是整天都学习。','Reading for half an hour does not mean studying all day.'),('长期保持习惯，短期也可以调整；困了先休息。','Maintain the habit long-term, but adjust in the short term; rest when sleepy.'),('经历和经验可以交流，今天的记录只写今天。','Experiences and practical knowledge can be shared; today’s record describes only today.')],
[('mainidea','What does the record avoid?',['Turning two days into a permanent daily streak','Mentioning a duration','Allowing rest'],0),('detail','How long was the reading interval?',['Half an hour','All day','Two years'],0),('inference','Does a regular habit prohibit resting tomorrow?',['No','Yes','Only if someone has experience'],0)],[(1,'持续'),(4,'休息')]),
text(u,'media','The bottle has a habit too','Read an original scene about a recurring small mistake.',[
('我总忘记带水，水瓶也总待在家。','I always forget water; the bottle always stays home too.'),('那它比你更有规律。','Then its routine is more regular than yours.'),('好，今天先拿水，再走二十分钟。','Fine; today take water first, then walk twenty minutes.'),('它终于换个地方休息了。','It finally gets to rest somewhere different.')],
[('inference','What makes the joke work?',['The bottle repeatedly stays home because it is forgotten','The bottle can walk independently','Water guarantees a perfect streak'],0)],drama=True),
dict(tf=[('通常','通常周末去，这周休息。','Usually go at weekends; rest this week.','This week is an exception.',True,'通常 allows an exception.'),('连续','连续两天去了。','Went on two consecutive days.','Went every day for a year.',False,'Only two consecutive days are stated.')],reply=[('困','我有点困，今天怎么办？','I am sleepy; what should I do today?',['先休息，下次再练。','整天跑，不能休息。','二十分钟就是两点。'],0,'Rest is permitted by the plan.'),('持续','今天散步持续了多久？','How long did today’s walk last?',['整整二十分钟。','明天早上九点。','两个星期六。'],0,'Answer duration, not a clock time.')],fill=[('坚持','坚持练习，也要休息。','Keep practising and also rest.'),('定期','我们定期整理记录。','We organize the records regularly.')],match=[('整整',[('走了二十分钟。','Walked for twenty minutes.'),('看书看了半个小时。','Read for half an hour.'),('等了二十分钟，还没到。','Waited twenty minutes; the person has not arrived.')]),('经历',[('今天没跑步。','Did not jog today.'),('这周连续两天去了。','Went on two consecutive days this week.'),('明天想休息。','Wants to rest tomorrow.')])]),
[('Check before inviting','你明天有空吗？困的话先休息。','Are you free tomorrow? Rest first if sleepy.','A habit is not consent to every invitation.'),('Give an actual duration','今天走了二十分钟，没有跑步。','Walked twenty minutes today; no jogging.','Report the activity and interval separately.')],
[('今天跑了吗？','Did you jog today?','State today’s action',['没有，只散步。']),('走了多久？','How long did you walk?','Give the actual duration',['走了二十分钟。'])],
'Native check: pragmatic emphasis 总/总是 versus strict frequency, 往往 tendencies, duration word order with an object and continuing 了…了; bottle-personification joke. Nutrition vocabulary is recognition content, not a diet prescription. Native review pending.')

u='s3-u12'
write(u,'再试一次，办法换一换',['Use 再 for a further future attempt','Coordinate help with 尽量 and 亲自','Track an actual result rather than award an invented score'],[
('尽量','as much as possible; try to','cố gắng hết mức','adverb','尽量说清楚，不要急着说快。','Try to speak clearly rather than rush to speak fast.'),('亲自','personally; in person','đích thân','adverb','这句话我亲自读一次。','I will personally read this sentence once.'),('继续','to continue','tiếp tục','verb','先休息，再继续。','Rest first, then continue.'),('反复','repeatedly; repetition','lặp đi lặp lại','adverb','反复听这一句，不是一直重来全部。','Listen repeatedly to this sentence, rather than restart everything constantly.'),('训练','training; to train','luyện tập','noun','训练记录写实际结果。','The training record states actual results.'),('克服','to overcome','khắc phục','verb','慢慢克服困难，不保证一次成功。','Overcome difficulties gradually, without guaranteeing success in one attempt.'),('困难','difficulty; difficult','khó khăn','noun','这个困难是第二句听不清。','The difficulty is not hearing the second sentence clearly.'),('改造','to remodel; transform','cải tạo','verb','改造活动室，不是随便改朋友的计划。','Remodel the activity room, rather than arbitrarily alter a friend’s plan.'),('采取','to take; adopt a measure','áp dụng','verb','先采取一个简单办法。','Adopt one simple method first.'),('采用','to adopt; use','sử dụng; áp dụng','verb','这次采用慢一点的速度。','Use a slightly slower speed this time.'),('加强','to strengthen','tăng cường','verb','加强练习，也不能忘记休息。','Strengthen practice without forgetting to rest.'),('加快','to accelerate','tăng tốc','verb','还没听清楚，不急着加快。','Not yet hearing clearly; do not rush to accelerate.'),('目标','goal; target','mục tiêu','noun','目标是听懂两句，不是拿满分。','The goal is to understand two sentences, not earn full marks.'),('进展','progress; development','tiến triển','noun','进展写在笔记里。','Progress is recorded in the notes.'),('效果','effect; result','hiệu quả','noun','办法有没有效果，要再检查。','Check again whether the method has an effect.'),('压力','pressure','áp lực','noun','压力太大时，可以停一下。','When pressure is excessive, one may pause.'),('力量','strength; power','sức mạnh','noun','互相帮助，也要尊重各自的力量。','Help each other while respecting each person’s capacity.'),('决心','determination','quyết tâm','noun','有决心，也不等于已经完成。','Determination does not mean completion.'),('把握','confidence; to grasp','nắm chắc; tin chắc','noun','我对第一句有把握，第二句还不确定。','I am confident about the first sentence, but unsure about the second.'),('成功','to succeed; successful','thành công','verb','这次成功听懂第一句。','This time successfully understood the first sentence.'),('成果','result; achievement','thành quả','noun','成果是听懂一句，不是整个课程完成。','The achievement is understanding one sentence, not completing the entire course.'),('成就','achievement; accomplishment','thành tựu','noun','小成就也可以记下来。','A small achievement can also be recorded.')],
[grammar(u,'三16','再：在一个条件或步骤之后','Place a further action after a stated prerequisite',
'先听，再说 orders steps. 等听清楚了再加快 makes understanding a prerequisite. 再试一次 is another future attempt; 又试了一次 reports another past attempt. 再 also appears in 如果再听不懂… for a further hypothetical occasion. Do not infer that every 再 means an event already happened.',[('先听，再说。','Listen first, then speak.'),('等听清楚了再加快。','Increase speed after hearing clearly.'),('如果再听不懂，就换一个办法。','If still unable to understand on another attempt, change the method.')],('昨天再试了一次。','昨天又试了一次。','Use 又 for a reported repeated past event in this context.')),
grammar(u,'三17','互相 / 相互 / 尽量 / 亲自','Coordinate reciprocal help and personal action',
'我们互相帮助 / 相互帮助 describes help in both directions, unlike 我帮你 alone. 尽量 says to do as much as circumstances allow; it does not guarantee the result. 亲自 says the person acts rather than delegating; it does not mean alone or without help. 我亲自读，你帮我听 is consistent.',[('我们互相帮助。','We help each other.'),('尽量说清楚，不一定马上成功。','Try to speak clearly; success need not be immediate.'),('我亲自读，你帮我听。','I read it personally; you help listen.')],('亲自读，就是不能接受帮助。','我亲自读，也可以请你帮助。','Personal action does not exclude assistance.'))],
text(u,'d','One clear sentence is an actual result','Find the new method and the remaining difficulty.',[
('这次目标是听懂两句，你有把握吗？','The goal is to understand two sentences this time; are you confident?'),('第一句有把握，第二句还听不清。','Confident about the first, but still cannot hear the second clearly.'),('那采用慢一点的速度，反复听第二句。','Then use a slower speed and listen repeatedly to the second sentence.'),('我亲自读一次，你帮我听。','I will read it once myself; help me listen.'),('好，先听清楚，再加快。压力大就停一下。','Fine; hear clearly before accelerating. Pause if the pressure is too high.'),('这次第一句成功，第二句还要再试。记录不写全对。','The first sentence succeeded; the second still needs another try. Do not record everything correct.')],
[('mainidea','What is the plan?',['Target the unclear sentence slowly and record actual results','Restart every lesson at full speed','Claim both sentences are correct'],0),('detail','Which sentence remains unclear?',['The second','The first','Neither'],0),('inference','May someone help while the speaker reads personally?',['Yes','No','Only after a perfect score'],0)],drama=True),
text(u,'r','The next attempt has a method','Read the prerequisite before increasing speed.',[
('目标是听懂两句，这次只成功听懂第一句。','The goal is two understood sentences; this time only the first succeeded.'),('困难在第二句，不需要一直重来全部。','The difficulty is in the second sentence; there is no need to restart everything constantly.'),('采用慢一点的速度，反复听，再亲自读一次。','Use a slower speed, listen repeatedly, then read it personally once.'),('互相帮助不等于代替别人完成，亲自读也不等于一个人做。','Mutual help does not mean doing another’s task; reading personally does not mean working alone.'),('等听清楚了再加快；如果再听不懂，就采取另一个办法。','Increase speed after hearing clearly; if another attempt remains unclear, adopt another method.'),('小成果可以记录，第二句未完成，也不写满分。','Record the small achievement; with the second sentence unfinished, do not record full marks.')],
[('mainidea','What should the record contain?',['One achieved sentence and one unfinished sentence','A guessed perfect score','Only the loudness'],0),('detail','When should speed increase?',['After hearing clearly','Before the first listen','Whenever someone feels pressure'],0),('inference','Does determination alone prove both sentences understood?',['No','Yes','Only if the attempt is personal'],0)],[(2,'采用'),(5,'成果')]),
text(u,'media','The second sentence can wait for clarity','Read an original verse about another attempt.',[
('第一句懂了，第二句再听。','The first is understood; listen to the second again.'),('速度慢一点，意思看清。','A little slower: make the meaning clear.'),('互相帮一下，亲自说一句。','Help each other; say one sentence yourself.'),('进展有多少，就记到哪里。','Record progress only as far as it actually goes.')],
[('inference','What does the verse recommend?',['An honest partial result and a further attempt','An automatic perfect score','Never accepting help'],0)]),
dict(tf=[('亲自','我亲自读，你帮我听。','I read personally; you help listen.','Personal action can include help.',True,'The person reads while another assists.'),('成果','只听懂第一句，第二句未完成。','Only the first is understood; the second is unfinished.','Both sentences have been understood.',False,'The second remains unfinished.')],reply=[('加快','第二句还听不清，先加快吗？','The second remains unclear; speed up first?',['先慢一点，听清楚了再加快。','先写满分就行。','亲自就是不能帮助。'],0,'Understanding is the prerequisite.'),('目标','这次结果怎么记录？','How should this result be recorded?',['第一句听懂，第二句还要试。','两句都全对。','困难就是没有成果。'],0,'Keep partial success and remaining work distinct.')],fill=[('尽量','尽量说清楚，不要急。','Try to speak clearly; do not rush.'),('继续','先休息，再继续。','Rest first, then continue.')],match=[('采取',[('采取一个办法。','Adopt a method.'),('采用慢一点的速度。','Use a slightly slower speed.'),('等听清楚了再加快。','Speed up after hearing clearly.')]),('把握',[('第一句有把握。','Confident about the first sentence.'),('第二句还不确定。','Unsure about the second.'),('压力大就停一下。','Pause if pressure is high.')])]),
[('Offer reciprocal help','我读，你帮我听；下次换你。','I read and you help listen; next time we swap.','State both directions rather than presume reciprocity.'),('Report partial success','第一句懂了，第二句还要试。','The first is understood; the second needs another try.','Do not erase the partial achievement or exaggerate it.')],
[('先加快吗？','Increase speed first?','State the prerequisite',['先听清楚，再加快。']),('第二句懂了吗？','Is the second sentence understood?','Report uncertainty',['还没听清楚。'])],
'Native check: 再 conditional/sequencing senses versus 又 past repetition, 互相/相互 reciprocity, 尽量 limits, 亲自 versus 独自; 采取措施 versus 采用方法 collocations. Actual partial achievements only; no invented learner grading. Native review pending.')

